WEBVTT

00:36.072 --> 00:42.514
The city sleeps in shades of grey Another dawn

00:42.534 --> 00:49.617
begins, another street, another day When no one

00:49.917 --> 00:57.260
ever wins, a hollow echo in the square A promise

00:57.340 --> 01:01.781
whispered low, of somewhere else, beyond

01:01.902 --> 01:07.793
compare A place where true things grow The faces

01:07.893 --> 01:15.175
blur, a passing stream A river deep and wide Lost

01:15.315 --> 01:21.377
in a half-forgoing dream Where do the lost ones

01:21.437 --> 01:27.868
hide? Do you hear I? A whisper on the wind, a

01:27.968 --> 01:34.369
melody so clear Oh, the true light gleams

01:38.290 --> 01:42.411
Will you come back to where the true light gleams

01:42.511 --> 01:44.872
And home is always near

02:00.980 --> 02:07.225
We chase the shadows on the wall Illusions that

02:07.305 --> 02:13.630
we build Afraid to leap, afraid to fall A

02:13.690 --> 02:18.214
prophesy fulfilled The painted smiles a

02:18.274 --> 02:25.020
masquerade To hide the fading spark A fragile

02:25.100 --> 02:31.246
fortress we have made Against the growing dark,

02:31.826 --> 02:38.989
but in the distance I can see A shimmer in the air,

02:39.009 --> 02:45.672
a different kind of mystery A world beyond

02:45.792 --> 02:53.427
compare Do you hear I whisper on the wind a melody

02:53.487 --> 02:59.090
so clear? Oh, the true life gleams

03:03.092 --> 03:07.174
Will you come back to where the true life gleams

03:07.274 --> 03:09.775
and home is always near?

03:13.152 --> 03:17.215
Through fractured prisms, light divides In

03:17.275 --> 03:22.760
pair and sharp and bright Thou sandpats, where

03:22.800 --> 03:28.782
fate presides Between the day and night Is I a

03:28.822 --> 03:35.963
vision? Just a trace A trick of weary eyes Or is

03:36.043 --> 03:41.864
there truly such a place Beneath those shifting

03:41.944 --> 03:48.806
skies? Shelter from the endless rain A refuge

03:48.906 --> 04:00.021
from the cold A story waiting to unfold, again to

04:00.441 --> 04:00.681
be

04:15.209 --> 04:15.429
told.

04:33.372 --> 04:39.533
Do you hear it? A whisper on the wind, a melody so

04:39.613 --> 04:45.075
clear Oh, the true light gleams

04:48.695 --> 04:51.936
Will you come back to where the true light

04:52.056 --> 04:55.737
gleams? And home is always near

05:03.494 --> 05:04.183
Thanks for watching!

